能叠加为意外的系统性失败。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsqu0nr604oeroz2rh6b6mqt","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/multiagent-systems","publishedAt":"2026-08-14T00:00:51.699Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-14mqazp","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsqu0nr604oeroz2rh6b6mqt","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-14T07:03:52.453Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-14mqazp","name":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-14T07:03:52.453Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Anthropic 研究指出，随着 AI 智能体在共享代码库、市场等社会系统中承担更多任务，智能体间交互量或将超过人机交互。实验显示，45 个协调智能体在 2700 万 token 运行中发现 266 个漏洞，而独立并行方法在 650 万 token 中发现 21 个，两种方法仅 12 个重叠，且协调智能体学会专业化分工。研究同时警示个体层面的良性行为怪癖可能叠加为意外的系统性失败。","reportEdition":"2026-08-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsrrgfq302mbro0ns0eqnzc8","title":"当“遗忘”无需成本：利用低影响力数据点降低机器学习计算开销","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-14T00:00:51.699Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsrrgfq302mbro0ns0eqnzc8","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/unlearning-low-influence-points"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsrrgfq302mbro0ns0eqnzc8","title":"当“遗忘”无需成本：利用低影响力数据点降低机器学习计算开销","originalTitle":"","summary":"苹果机器学习研究团队提出，在模型遗忘任务中，对训练数据中影响可忽略的点无需逐一移除，从而降低计算成本。通过对比语言与视觉任务中的影响力函数，他们识别出对模型输出影响极小的数据子集，并据此优化遗忘流程。该方法挑战了现有遗忘技术对所有遗忘集数据点一视同仁的做法。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsrrgfq302mbro0ns0eqnzc8","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/unlearning-low-influence-points","publishedAt":"2026-08-14T00:00:51.699Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsrrgfq302mbro0ns0eqnzc8","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-14T07:03:52.453Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-14T07:03:52.453Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"苹果机器学习研究团队提出，在模型遗忘任务中，对训练数据中影响可忽略的点无需逐一移除，从而降低计算成本。通过对比语言与视觉任务中的影响力函数，他们识别出对模型输出影响极小的数据子集，并据此优化遗忘流程。该方法挑战了现有遗忘技术对所有遗忘集数据点一视同仁的做法。","reportEdition":"2026-08-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsruetoy027hrozeecu4ixrc","title":"GPT-5.6 构建者指南：如何以更低成本实现前沿智能体性能","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-14T00:00:51.699Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsruetoy027hrozeecu4ixrc","https://openai.com/index/builders-guide-to-gpt-5-6"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsruetoy027hrozeecu4ixrc","title":"GPT-5.6 构建者指南：如何以更低成本实现前沿智能体性能","originalTitle":"","summary":"GPT-5.6 模型家族以更低成本实现前沿级智能体性能，并新增推理持久化、原生多智能体编排和程序化工具调用等 API 能力。在 ARC-AGI-3 上，启用保留推理和压缩后，Sol 得分从 13.3% 跃升至 38.3%，且输出 token 减少约 6 倍。Luna 在 BrowseComp 上以 84.04% 的得分追平 GPT-5.5（84.36%），成本从 $33.27 降至 $1.33。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/c